<title>JAPAN: SS Pharmaceutical, German firm to announce drug.</title>
<headline>SS Pharmaceutical, German firm to announce drug.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>SS Pharmaceutical Co Ltd said on Wednesday it would announce a new stomach medicine jointly developed with German drug company Boehringer Ingelheim International GmbH later in the day.</p>
<p>The two companies will release a statement at 11 a.m. (0200 GMT) and plan a joint news conference at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT), an SS spokesman said.</p>
<p>The medicine will be an over-the-counter product, he said.</p>
